  6 | 1:eq:5                 | t       | t       | t         | t         |         5
  7 | 1:in:5|6|7|19999       | t       | t       | t         | t         |        20
  8 | 1:in:5|5|5             | t       | t       | t         | t         |         5
  9 | 0:eq:3;2:ge:50000      | t       | t       | t         | t         |      7026
 10 | 0:eq:3;1:eq:5          | t       | t       | t         | t         |         1
(10 rows)

